      "explanation": "Turek endorses the quotation and extends it to any argument for atheism or subjectivism (E1092–1103), potentially preempting objections through their supposedly inevitable inferiority to intuition. However, he supplies a comparative justification about basic beliefs, rather than a slogan replacing reasons; whether he excludes stronger counterarguments regardless of merits remains unclear."
